// ATR expresses momentum in units of the instrument's own volatility, so one
// reading means the same thing across instruments, timeframes and volatility
// regimes, where the raw MACD spread does not. Spiroglou reads the line in
// ranges: beyond 150 or -150 is an overextended move, between -50 and 50 a
// ranging market, and the bands in between a trend.
//
// Formula and more info at https://ta-lib.org/functions/macdv.
//
