//   - optInFastPeriod: Period of the fast EMA. Default 12; range 2 to 100000;
//     IntegerDefault selects the default.
//   - optInSlowPeriod: Period of the slow EMA and of the Average True Range.
//     Default 26; range 2 to 100000; IntegerDefault selects the default.
//   - optInSignalPeriod: Smoothing period of the signal line. Default 9; range
//     1 to 100000; IntegerDefault selects the default.
